        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 4820bottom-E3020, Baden Entry Door Handleset with Touchscreen Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Baden Handleset with Electronic Keypad Lock has a EMTOUCH keypad for easy access. Instead of carrying around keys, all you need is a single code. The Touchscreen Deadbolt Baden Handleset can be programmed with up to 20 codes and comes factory programmed with 2 unique codes so you can use your new handleset right away. The transitional look of this Baden Entry Door Handleset with Touchscreen Deadbolt makes it a great choice for home remodels. Choose your favorite interior trim lever or knob. The Baden Tubular Handleset with Electronic Lock is available in several modern finishes.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Baden Tubular Handleset with Electronic Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to use installation and programming instructions included.</li> \r\n<li>Factory programmed with 2 unique, secure user codes for use right out of the box.</li> \r\n<li>Can be programmed with up to 20 user codes of your choice.</li> \r\n<li>Codes can be added and deleted.</li> \r\n<li>Easy lock operation, simply push the Emtek button and turn the exterior thumb turn to lock.</li> \r\n<li>Easy unlock operation, enter the 4 digit code and turn the exterior thumb turn.</li> \r\n<li>Programming changes can be made easily using the keypad.</li> \r\n<li>Sleek keypad has a protective coating to prevent wear patterns.</li> \r\n<li>Illuminated keypad for easy and quick operation after dark.</li> \r\n<li>Low battery indicator lets you know when it’s time to change the battery.</li> \r\n<li>Emtek’s standard mechanical and finish warranties along with a 2 year warranty on electronic components. </li> \r\n<li>Backup Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Electronic Baden Entrance Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Plate Height: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Plate Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1-7/8”</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Plate Height: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 8-5/8\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-4820bottom-E3020-specifications.pdf?v=1704262425\"><b>Emtek 4820-E3020 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Handle-B-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262345\"><b>Emtek Tubular Entryset Template Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
